title: Windows Quick Assist Remote Access Abuse
id: ff276577-7542-493a-8b78-bf412fb01fb2
status: experimental
description: Detects execution of Windows Quick Assist (quickassist.exe), a built-in remote-assistance tool increasingly abused in social-engineering intrusions to obtain hands-on remote control of a victim host.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1219/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\quickassist.exe'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate IT remote support
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1219
